      "writtenOn": "2024-12-13T20:16:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having both `objectBoundingBox` and `onObjectBoundingBox` virtual is kinda confusing and breaks the usual pattern of non-virtual public entry point + virtual protected impl.\n\nEven if it\u0027s more typing, I think it would be cleaner to introduce a separate obb virtual just for TransformableNode subclasses (`onTransformableObjectBoundingBox`?), and terminate the `onObjectBoundingBox` overrides in TransformableNode (make it final).\n\nThen convert all TransformableNode subclasses to override `onTransformableObjectBoundingBox` instead of `onObjectBoundingBox`, and implement the bounding box transform fix in `SkSVGTransformableNode:: onObjectBoundingBox`.",
      "revId": "f349673e2ce6b6c617de80741b4bc768a69198e5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
